      "description": "分类筛选保留按钮语义。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">米粉面馆</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{min-height:38px;padding:7px 14px;border:1px solid var(--accent,#b74428);border-radius:9px;background:var(--accent-soft,#f8e9e2);color:var(--accent,#b74428);font:13px sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip:hover{background:var(--subtle,#edf1e8)}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#b74428);outline-offset:3px}.ds-chip:active{transform:scale(.98)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Food card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "feature-surface",
      "description": "图片、菜名与描述直接组成菜单。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><button aria-label=\"查看黄焖鸡米饭\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"黄焖鸡米饭\"><small>快餐便当</small><strong>黄焖鸡米饭</strong><p>鸡肉软烂，汤汁浓郁</p></button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:270px}.ds-card button{display:block;border:0;padding:0;background:none;color:var(--text,#27352c);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font:13px/1.65 sans-serif}.ds-card img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px}.ds-card small{display:block;margin-top:13px;color:var(--muted,#626e65);font-size:11px}.ds-card strong{display:block;font-size:17px;margin:4px 0 5px}.ds-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted,#626e65)}.ds-card button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#b74428);outline-offset:4px}.ds-card button:hover strong{color:var(--accent,#b74428)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "App brand mark",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "brand-mark",
      "description": "Fixed-color bowl and chopsticks mark. 42px desktop, 38px mobile; v3.2.2.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-brand-mark\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"none\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"tomato\" x1=\"64\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"432\" y2=\"512\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#F0784E\"/>\n      <stop offset=\".46\" stop-color=\"#E55936\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#C83C28\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"porcelain\" x1=\"175\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"309\" y2=\"401\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#FFFDF5\"/>\n      <stop offset=\".54\" stop-color=\"#F9EEDB\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#EACEAF\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"rim\" x1=\"256\" y1=\"237\" x2=\"256\" y2=\"292\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#FFFDF5\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#F3DDC0\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"inside\" x1=\"256\" y1=\"235\" x2=\"256\" y2=\"290\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#B85029\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#EA9B54\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"chopsticks\" x1=\"363\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"271\" y2=\"245\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#FFF8E7\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#F1D7AD\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"gold\" x1=\"268\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"313\" y2=\"272\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#FFD36F\"/>\n      <stop offset=\".65\" stop-color=\"#F4B13E\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#DE872B\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"leaf\" x1=\"154\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"248\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#819B59\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#3F6949\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <filter id=\"soft-shadow\" x=\"-.3\" y=\"-.25\" width=\"1.6\" height=\"1.65\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"12\" stdDeviation=\"10\" flood-color=\"#852C1E\" flood-opacity=\".2\"/>\n    </filter>\n    <clipPath id=\"tile-clip\"><rect id=\"tile-shape\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" rx=\"112\"/></clipPath>\n  </defs>\n  <g id=\"background\" clip-path=\"url(#tile-clip)\">\n    <path fill=\"url(#tomato)\" d=\"M0 0h512v512H0z\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"mark\" filter=\"url(#soft-shadow)\">\n    <g stroke=\"url(#chopsticks)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"m270 235 96-108\" stroke-width=\"17\"/>\n      <path d=\"m297 250 96-97\" stroke-width=\"17\"/>\n    </g>\n    <path d=\"m217 373-7 16c-2 6 2 11 9 11h74c7 0 11-5 9-11l-7-16\" fill=\"url(#porcelain)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M112 266c6 67 66 120 144 120s138-53 144-120H112Z\" fill=\"url(#porcelain)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"256\" cy=\"264\" rx=\"144\" ry=\"38\" fill=\"url(#rim)\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"256\" cy=\"260\" rx=\"126\" ry=\"26\" fill=\"url(#inside)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M160 261c2-37 25-61 57-61 37-1 65 28 66 63-37 15-85 14-123-2Z\" fill=\"#FFF4DE\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"240\" r=\"43\" fill=\"url(#gold)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M268 215c8-6 18-8 28-5\" stroke=\"#FFE8A2\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".7\"/>\n    <path d=\"M195 253c-36-5-55-36-44-73 34 7 59 35 49 64l-5 9Z\" fill=\"url(#leaf)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M157 192c6 21 16 38 32 50\" stroke=\"#B6C580\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".65\"/>\n    <path d=\"M115 267c31 32 251 32 282 0-10 66-68 119-141 119S125 333 115 267Z\" fill=\"url(#porcelain)\"/>\n    <path d=\"M117 267c38 31 240 31 278 0\" stroke=\"#FFF9ED\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n    <path d=\"M146 310c15 23 40 40 67 47\" stroke=\"#FFFEF9\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg></span>",
      "css": ".ds-brand-mark { display: inline-flex; width: 42px; height: 42px; } .ds-brand-mark svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; } @media (max-width: 760px) { .ds-brand-mark { width: 38px; height: 38px; } }"
    },
    {
      "name": "天气地区卡片",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "weather-card",
      "description": "用户指定的天气样式；此面板为示例，生产值来自实时接口。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-weather-card\" data-scene=\"partly-cloudy\"><div class=\"ds-weather-place\"><h3>天气示例</h3><p>示例地区</p></div><div class=\"ds-weather-degrees\">20<span class=\"ds-weather-unit\">°</span></div><div class=\"ds-weather-current\"><span id=\"ds-weather-description\">多云</span><span id=\"ds-weather-range\">最高 25° · 最低 17°</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-weather-card { position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto; grid-template-rows: 1fr auto; gap: 26px 14px; min-height: 190px; padding: 25px 26px 21px; border-radius: 20px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(120deg,#315c87,#4c759b); font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif; }\n.ds-weather-card::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0,rgba(205,229,251,.18),transparent 68%); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"idle\"] { background: linear-gradient(115deg,#334e65,#4b667a); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"clear\"] { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#265992,#4275a4); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"cloudy\"], .ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"fog\"] { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#405d78,#536d82); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"rain\"], .ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"storm\"] { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#2f435d,#4d6279); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"snow\"] { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#466078,#59758a); }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"night\"] { background: linear-gradient(120deg,#1b2948,#394569); }\n.ds-weather-place { align-self: start; min-width: 0; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.ds-weather-place h3 { font-size: clamp(24px,2.6vw,30px); line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.025em; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis; overflow: hidden; }\n.ds-weather-place p { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #f0f5fb; margin-top: 7px; }\n.ds-weather-place .icon { width: 12px; height: 12px; flex: 0 0 auto; }\n.ds-weather-degrees { display: flex; align-self: start; font-size: 76px; line-height: .95; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: -.035em; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.ds-weather-unit { font-size: .8em; line-height: 1; }\n.ds-weather-art { position: absolute; right: 102px; top: 50px; width: 140px; height: 102px; opacity: .82; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }\n.ds-weather-art > svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n.ds-weather-card[data-scene=\"idle\"] .ds-weather-art { right: 48px; top: 41px; width: 90px; height: 90px; opacity: .12; }\n.ds-weather-art > .icon { stroke-width: .8; }\n.ds-weather-current { grid-column: 1/-1; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 12px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n#ds-weather-description { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 550; }\n#ds-weather-range { font-size: 12px; color: #f0f5fb; }\n.ds-weather-card[data-state=\"connecting\"] .ds-weather-degrees, .ds-weather-card[data-state=\"locating\"] .ds-weather-degrees, .ds-weather-card[data-state=\"loading\"] .ds-weather-degrees { opacity: .7; }\n.ds-weather-place h3,.ds-weather-place p{margin:0}.ds-weather-place p{margin-top:7px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "鲜食菜单",
    "overview": "v3.2.0 的视觉系统围绕真实食物和明确选择建立。白色内容区、植物色中性背景与珊瑚色交互强调形成层次，照片承担主要视觉内容。中文任务界面使用本机字体，保持快速加载与可读性。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "菜品照片与直接选择动作相邻。",
      "页面依靠留白、背景和少量分隔线组织内容。",
      "主次操作、选中与等待状态可辨认。",
      "桌面、手机及深色模式保持同一套组件语言。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Semantic State",
        "body": "强调、成功和错误分别使用对应语义 token，不能只靠颜色表达状态。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "天气与外观分开",
        "body": "卡片昼夜由天气数据决定，不由深色主题决定；旧天气保留时明确标注。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "手机图片预算",
        "body": "原生 picture 在手机使用 480/768px，768px 低于 90 kB；桌面保留 960px，原图用于分享与回退。",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 让照片、菜名和选择动作保持直接的阅读顺序。",
      "Do 以共享语义 token 维护明暗与六色主题。",
      "Do 同时保留键盘、减少动态效果、长名称和图片失败状态。",
      "Do 把派生图片与原图一起发布，并检查缩略图大小预算。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 将店铺参考图表达成本店实拍，或把口味标签当作食材保证。",
      "Don't 在动画每一帧重建图片、重绘盘面或更新整页。",
      "Don't 为背景装饰引入持续动画和额外网络依赖。"
    ]
  }
}
